---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Prayers | M. Baldwin-Smith" description="Original prayers written for everyday moments and sacred seasons.">
  <h1>Prayers</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Prayer is where I return to breathe again. These pieces are written for real people walking through real life&mdash;
    gratitude, grief, celebration, and quiet perseverance.
  </p>

  <section class="prayer-list">
    <article>
      <h2>Dawn Prayer</h2>
      <p>
        God of first light, teach me to rise open-handed. Let the day break gently over my responsibilities, and remind me
        that your mercies are already waiting at the door.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <h2>Prayer for Community</h2>
      <p>
        Knit us together by the wisdom of your Spirit. Help us choose generosity when convenience feels easier, and grant
        us courage to keep showing up for one another.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <h2>Evening Exhale</h2>
      <p>
        When the day closes, gather every anxious thought into your keeping. May rest be an act of trust, and sleep become
        a sanctuary where grace is rehearsed.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lead {
    max-width: 48rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .prayer-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  article {
    background: white;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 22px -18px rgba(37, 56, 88, 0.6);
  }
</style>
